Commercial Cleaner

Location: Brisbane, Queensland
Employment Type: Full-Time

$70,000 - $75,000 per annum plus Superannuation

We are seeking reliable and motivated Commercial Cleaners to provide cleaning services across commercial premises and facilities.
Key Responsibilities:

•	Performing cleaning duties within offices, commercial buildings and shared facilities;
•	Vacuuming, mopping, dusting and maintaining floors and surfaces;
•	Cleaning bathrooms, kitchens and common areas to a high standard;
•	Handling rubbish removal and maintaining hygienic conditions;
•	Operating cleaning equipment and using cleaning products safely;
•	Following company procedures and workplace safety requirements;
•	Reporting maintenance or safety concerns to supervisors where necessary.

Requirements:

•	Previous cleaning experience at least 2 years relevant experience
•	Reliable and professional attitude;
•	Ability to work independently and within a team environment;
•	Strong attention to detail and time management skills.
•	Language skills - English

Please submit your CV and cover letter to;- admin@bmpropertyservices.com.au
